Description: The 3D sentences of digiKam and Showfoto in the edition's languages (ORDER 551c)
 The eleven sentences the 3D menu keeps, the same as KPhotoAlbum's and in its words, and the sentence that tells a 3D
 choice could not follow a moved file, in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Spanish, Japanese, Korean and
 Chinese. The per-file entries and Enable 3D are the stereo layer's own and come from its catalogues.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
